Package: tulpaObs
Title: Bayesian Occupancy Models via tulpa
Version: 0.0.12
Authors@R: person("Gilles", "Colling", email = "gilles.colling@univie.ac.at",
    role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-3070-6066"))
Description: Single-season and multi-season Bayesian occupancy models with
    spatial, temporal, and random effects. Plugs occupancy likelihoods into the
    tulpa engine for HMC/NUTS inference with automatic differentiation.
